  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile RNA-only (config_002) achieves higher accuracy (0.5907) than singleprofile RNA-only (config_001) or multimodal singleprofile (config_016). This experiment tests whether combining multiprofile RNA data with multimodal image data (ResNet50) using avgpool aggregation (aligned with config_002's aggregation) can further improve performance. It isolates the effect of adding image modality to a multiprofile RNA foundation, a critical design choice with potential for significant gains."
}

